# Terraform state can contain sensitive values (and always contains resource
# metadata). Never commit it. Use a remote backend (GCS) for real projects.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
crash.log
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

# Saved plan files are binary and can embed sensitive values — never commit.
tfplan
*.tfplan

# The provider lock file (.terraform.lock.hcl) is intentionally NOT ignored —
# commit it so provider versions are pinned and reproducible.

# Local scratch
*.log

# Generated slide-deck build artifacts (run ./build-deck.sh to regenerate)
deck.md
deck-full.md
*.import.md
